    {
      "templateId": "standard-agent",
      "seedOnFreshProfile": true,
      "document": {
        "comments": "Standard: the ready-to-use default workflow. Chat Input -> Agent (the full native tool set: files, shell, Python, web search, skills, goals, subagents and background jobs) -> Chat Output -> Wait for Input. The agent begins work immediately instead of planning first, grounding itself with reads and searches and tracking multi-step work with the task list and the goal. Choose 'Planer' when a plan-first pass is wanted. The agent uses the DSH compaction-basic plus tool-result-pruner policy (thresholdChars 81920, headChars 73728, tailChars 4096) so one bounded 64 KiB file read survives pruning intact. A project-specific MCP binding is omitted so the workflow runs in any profile, and Codex/Claude Code delegation is omitted until an enabled external agent exists in Settings.",
        "edges": [
          {
            "id": "input-agent",
            "source": "input.1",
            "target": "agent.1"
          },
          {
            "id": "agent-output",
            "source": "agent.1",
            "target": "output.1"
          },
          {
            "id": "output-wait",
            "source": "output.1",
            "target": "wait.1"
          }
        ],
        "id": "workflow.standard-agent",
        "name": "Standard",
        "nodes": [
          {
